          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Benefits",
            "tab_content": "<p>Liposomal Glutathione may help with the following:</p><ul><li>Supports gut health and healthy glutathione levels*<br/></li><li>Supports the liver's natural detoxification*<br/></li><li>Provides antioxidant support for skin health*</li></ul>"
